  "bodyHash": "e5d1bd48413e893a",
  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">适用于 1.19+ 版本的下载：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier</strong></span></a></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/available for-1.18 | 1.17-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"219\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3gKDY2l\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Client Side-Required-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Server Side-Optional-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"199\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nhm6zO\" width=\"311\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Pick Up Notifier</strong> 添加了一个拾取日志，这是一个显示在屏幕角落的整洁列表。其中包括精美的物品图标！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">日志包含你刚刚拾取的所有物品和经验值。过时的条目会慢慢移出屏幕。默认情况下，显示位于屏幕右下角。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一些自定义选项包括：条目显示的刻数、条目移出屏幕所需的刻数、合并相同类型的条目、是否绘制物品图标以及物品名称的文本颜色。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">显示外观可以进一步自定义：显示所在的屏幕角落、相对于默认位置的 x 和 y 偏移量、整个显示允许使用的高度百分比以及自定义缩放比例。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 截图：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/268/938/2019-11-13_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/269/31/2019-11-15_18.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>显示大量拾取的物品</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>高度和文本颜色均可完全配置</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/269/30/2019-11-15_20.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/269/782/2019-11-23_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>可以隐藏物品图标，整个显示区域可自由移动</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>收集的经验值也会出现在显示中</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UKob5orhjmw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOiCgLJnMO5h0Srdf-xa17g\" rel=\"nofollow\">Juri TV</a> 的评测</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：我该如何配置这个模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未实现在游戏内直接编辑配置文件。相反，当你在世界中时，运行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令，选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取决于模组），然后点击聊天框中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），以便在单独的编辑器中手动编辑配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Pick Up Notifier 的开发得到了以下启发和帮助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teamcofh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TeamCoFH</strong></span></a>，他们早期版本的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cofh-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CoFH Core</span></a> 模组中包含了本模组的原始创意</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vz7MGCN.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
